{{!-- The Season tab: the wheel, the season you are in, and the control that ends it.

      It used to run wheel → a "Turn to <next>" panel → a "During <current>" section → the improvement
      board, which split one season across two blocks: the numbered steps described the season being
      rolled INTO while the gain, the checklist and the adjustments all belonged to the one the
      steading was IN. The box could be headed "Winter" over a line reading "Autumn, year 3".

      One box now, and it is the current season's. Turning the wheel is the small control under it.

      Params: seasons (SeasonsSnapshot). --}}
<div class="steading-seasons">

	{{> "stonetop.steading-season-wheel" seasons=seasons}}

	{{> "stonetop.steading-season-box" seasons=seasons}}

</div>
